return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 2.2.2','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:37+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:37+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'Hutumwa unapobofya Washa Babilim, na tena ikiwa tovuti inapaswa kujisajili upya: URL ya tovuti yako, matoleo ya WordPress, PHP na Babilim, lugha ya tovuti yako na lugha zinazotumika juu yake, na ufunguo wa umma uliozalishwa kwa ajili ya tovuti hii.','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'Hutumwa kwa kila ukaguzi: orodha ya programu jalizi na mandhari zilizosakinishwa pamoja na hali ya tafsiri yoyote ya Babilim iliyosakinishwa kwa ajili yake, lugha zinazotumika, na misimbo mifupi ya uchunguzi.','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'Kila ombi linajumuisha URL ya tovuti yako, na tokeni ya ufikiaji ya tovuti hujumuishwa kila huduma inapoihitaji.','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Kile ambacho Babilim hutuma kwa huduma','Your site\'s URL'=>'URL ya tovuti yako','WordPress version'=>'Toleo la WordPress','PHP version'=>'Toleo la PHP','Babilim version'=>'Toleo la Babilim','Your site\'s language'=>'Lugha ya tovuti yako','Languages in use on your site'=>'Lugha zinazotumika kwenye tovuti yako','A public key for this site'=>'Ufunguo wa umma wa tovuti hii','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'Ufunguo wa umma uliozalishwa kwa ajili ya tovuti hii, unaotumika kuthibitisha kwamba maombi yanatoka kweli kwenye tovuti hii. Ni nusu ya umma pekee hutumwa; nusu ya faragha hubaki kwenye tovuti yako.','Installed plugins and themes'=>'Programu jalizi na mandhari zilizosakinishwa','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'Faili chanzo (ikiwa tu utathibitisha upakiaji)','Diagnostic codes'=>'Misimbo ya uchunguzi','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'Hadi misimbo mifupi 20 ya uchunguzi (kwa mfano, faili ya tafsiri iliyoshindwa ukaguzi wake), kila mmoja ukiwa na programu jalizi au mandhari, lugha na wakati ulipotokea. Haina kamwe maandishi yoyote kutoka kwenye tovuti yako wala maandishi yoyote yaliyotafsiriwa.','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Tovuti %1$d kwenye mtandao huu imewekwa kufuta utambulisho wake wa Babilim programu-jalizi itakapofutwa. Leseni ya kulipia iliyounganishwa na tovuti hiyo haingeweza kurejeshwa kiotomatiki; ungelazimika kuwasiliana na Usaidizi wa Babilim kupitia %2$s. Ili kuhifadhi utambulisho, bofya Ghairi, ondoa tiki kwenye "Futa data yote ya Babilim wakati wa kusanidua" katika Mipangilio ya Babilim ya tovuti hiyo, kisha uzime tena. Zima hata hivyo?' . "\0" . 'Tovuti %1$d kwenye mtandao huu zimewekwa kufuta utambulisho wao wa Babilim programu-jalizi itakapofutwa. Leseni za kulipia zilizounganishwa na tovuti hizo haziwezi kurejeshwa kiotomatiki; ungelazimika kuwasiliana na Usaidizi wa Babilim kupitia %2$s. Ili kuhifadhi utambulisho, bofya Ghairi, ondoa tiki kwenye "Futa data yote ya Babilim wakati wa kusanidua" katika Mipangilio ya Babilim ya kila tovuti, kisha uzime tena. Zima hata hivyo?','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s): %3$s','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s hakuna cha kufanya.','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s: %2$s. Chagua lugha.','%d failed'=>'%d imeshindwa' . "\0" . '%d imeshindwa','%d not yet tried'=>'%d bado haijajaribiwa' . "\0" . '%d bado haijajaribiwa','%d report is waiting. "Always share" and "Don\'t share" apply to all of them.'=>'Ripoti %d inasubiri. "Shiriki kila wakati" na "Usishiriki" zinatumika kwa zote.' . "\0" . 'Ripoti %d zinasubiri. "Shiriki kila wakati" na "Usishiriki" zinatumika kwa zote.','%d skipped'=>'%d imerukwa' . "\0" . '%d imerukwa','%d succeeded'=>'%d imefanikiwa' . "\0" . '%d imefanikiwa','%d to install'=>'%d ya kusakinisha' . "\0" . '%d za kusakinisha','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(ufunguo wa umma uliozalishwa kwa ajili ya tovuti hii)','(detected)'=>'(imegunduliwa)','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(misimbo ya jumla na viwianishi pekee)','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Usafishaji ulisitishwa tarehe %1$s: %2$s. Hakuna kilichofutwa.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Faili moja katika kijenzi haikuweza kusomwa, kwa hivyo haikufungashwa.','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Mwenyeji anayehudumia ombi moja tu la PHP kwa wakati mmoja hawezi kukamilisha hatua hii.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Sehemu ya upakiaji iliendelea kushindwa, kwa hivyo upakiaji ulighairiwa.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Tafsiri haiwezi kuombwa kwa lugha hiyo kwenye tovuti hii kwa sasa.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'Uandishi wa faharasa ya tafsiri uligongana na ombi lingine tarehe %1$s (%2$s) na haukutekelezwa; toleo la hivi karibuni zaidi lilihifadhiwa.','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'Uandishi wa faharasa ya tafsiri tarehe %1$s (%2$s) haukukamilika na haukutekelezwa (%3$s).','Account'=>'Akaunti','Add another language'=>'Ongeza lugha nyingine','Advanced'=>'Mipangilio ya hali ya juu','All'=>'Vyote','All free-plan slots for this site are used'=>'Nafasi zote za mpango wa bure za tovuti hii zimetumika','All languages'=>'Lugha zote','Already in WordPress core'=>'Tayari ipo kwenye kiini cha WordPress','Already installed.'=>'Tayari imesakinishwa.','Always share'=>'Shiriki kila wakati','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Usakinishaji mwingine unaendelea; jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','Automatic installs'=>'Usakinishaji otomatiki','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Usakinishaji wa kiotomatiki sasa umezimwa; uwashe tena kwenye mipangilio ukitaka.','Available'=>'Zinazopatikana','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. While automatic installs are on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopatikana zinaweza kusakinishwa kwa mbofyo mmoja, na zile zinazokosekana zinaweza kuombwa. Usakinishaji otomatiki ukiwa umewashwa, tafsiri ambazo huduma inaorodhesha kuwa zinapatikana kwa lugha unazozisimamia husakinishwa wakati wa usawazishaji mara mbili kwa siku.','Available · %s'=>'Inapatikana · %s','Babilim'=>'Babilim','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim huongeza tafsiri za kila lugha iliyotiwa alama hapa.','Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site\'s public directory), or ask your host for one.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kuthibitisha folda ya muda nje ya tovuti, kwa hiyo kijenzi hakikufungashwa na hakuna kilichopakiwa. Bainisha BABILIM_TEMP_DIR katika wp-config.php kama folda inayoweza kuandikwa nje ya mzizi wa wavuti (kwa mfano folda iliyo kando ya, si ndani ya, saraka ya umma ya tovuti yako), au mwombe mwenyeji wako akupe moja.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kumaliza kukagua tovuti hii.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim haikuweza kukamilisha kuwezesha (%1$s): %2$s','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kukamilisha uthibitishaji wa tovuti hii (huduma haikuweza kuifikia tena). Usajili umesitishwa.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kuthibitisha tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kitakachopakuliwa wala kusakinishwa hadi uthibitishaji ufanikiwe.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kuthibitisha tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kinachopakuliwa wala kusakinishwa.','Babilim gets translations from the Babilim service for the plugins and themes on this site that have none for your language, and installs the ones your service plan covers.'=>'Babilim hupata tafsiri kutoka Huduma ya Babilim kwa programu-jalizi na mandhari za tovuti hii ambazo hazina tafsiri za lugha yako, na husakinisha zile zinazoshughulikiwa na mpango wa huduma wako.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim haijawashwa kwa tovuti hii bado.','Babilim has not installed any translation for this language.'=>'Babilim haijasakinisha tafsiri yoyote kwa lugha hii.','Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?'=>'Babilim imekumbwa na hitilafu. Shiriki ripoti ya hitilafu?','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Babilim imesakinisha tafsiri %d kiotomatiki tangu ziara yako ya mwisho.' . "\0" . 'Babilim imesakinisha tafsiri %d kiotomatiki tangu ziara yako ya mwisho.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim imezimwa. Hakuna kitakachotumwa tena; tafsiri zilizosakinishwa tayari zinaendelea kufanya kazi.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim imewashwa: tovuti hii imethibitishwa na kijenzi %d kimepatikana.' . "\0" . 'Babilim imewashwa: tovuti hii imethibitishwa na vijenzi %d vimepatikana.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim inawezesha na kukagua tovuti hii… (jaribio la mwisho: %s)','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim inawezesha na kukagua tovuti hii… Pakia upya ukurasa huu au subiri ukaguzi uliopangwa ukamilike.','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim haijawashwa.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim imewekwa kufuta utambulisho wa tovuti hii programu-jalizi itakapofutwa. Leseni ya kulipia iliyounganishwa na tovuti hii haingeweza kurejeshwa kiotomatiki; ungelazimika kuwasiliana na Usaidizi wa Babilim kupitia %s. Ili kuhifadhi utambulisho, bofya Ghairi, ondoa tiki kwenye "Futa data yote ya Babilim wakati wa kusanidua" katika Mipangilio ya Babilim, kisha uzime tena. Zima hata hivyo?','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim imeishiwa na muda kwa hatua hii na itaendelea katika ukaguzi unaofuata.','Babilim settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Babilim','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Usawazishaji wa Babilim umecheleweshwa kwa muda na huduma (kikomo cha kasi); utajaribu tena baada ya %s.','Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again.'=>'Babilim ilisasishwa wakati upakiaji huu ulikuwa unasubiri. Kifurushi cha zamani kilitupwa; tafadhali thibitisha upakiaji tena.','Babilim will upload these files from %1$s (version %2$s): every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in its main folder. They are used to find the text that needs translating and to identify the plugin or theme.'=>'Babilim itapakia faili hizi kutoka %1$s (toleo %2$s): kila faili ya .php na .js, kila faili ya block.json, na readme.txt, readme.md, style.css na theme.json katika folda kuu yake. Hutumiwa kupata maandishi yanayohitaji kutafsiriwa na kutambua programu jalizi au mandhari.','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest haipatikani: %s','Back'=>'Rudi','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Ulishanunua leseni ya kikoa hiki? Weka msimbo wa kurejesha uliopokea wakati wa malipo.','Broken placeholder'=>'Kishikilia nafasi kimeharibika','Build'=>'Toleo la kifurushi','Built'=>'Imejengwa','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Vitendo vya wingi vinatumika tu kwa lugha iliyochaguliwa ya kila kijenzi kilichochaguliwa.','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Vitendo vya wingi vinatumika kwa kila lugha inayolingana ya kila kijenzi kilichochaguliwa.','Bulk download:'=>'Upakuaji wa pamoja:','Bulk request:'=>'Ombi la pamoja:','Bulk update:'=>'Sasisho la pamoja:','Bundled with the plugin'=>'Imejumuishwa na programu-jalizi','Bundled with the theme'=>'Imejumuishwa na mandhari','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Kwa kubofya Wezesha, unakubali kutuma taarifa zilizoorodheshwa hapo juu kwa Babilim.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Kwa kuendelea unathibitisha kwamba una haki ya kupakia kijenzi hiki.','Cancel'=>'Ghairi','Category'=>'Kategoria','Check again'=>'Angalia tena','Check again now'=>'Angalia tena sasa','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'Malipo hayapatikani kwa tovuti hii kwa sasa.','Choose'=>'Chagua','Choose a category…'=>'Chagua kategoria…','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','Choose a language…'=>'Chagua lugha…','Clear filters'=>'Futa vichujio','Close'=>'Funga','Component'=>'Kijenzi','Confirm'=>'Thibitisha','Conflicting keys'=>'Funguo zinazogongana','Continue'=>'Endelea','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Endelea na kundi linalofuata (zimebaki %d)','Continuing…'=>'Inaendelea…','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'Imeshindwa kuhifadhi nakala ya %s kabla ya kuibadilisha.','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Imeshindwa kuunda faili ya kifurushi.','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Imeshindwa kubaini vijenzi vinavyotumika; faharasa iliyounganishwa iliyopo haikubadilishwa.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'Haikuweza kubaini programu-jalizi/mandhari zilizosakinishwa; usafishaji umerukwa, hakuna kilichofutwa.','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Imeshindwa kupakia orodha kamili ya lugha za WordPress.org kutoka kwenye huduma, kwa hivyo hakuna lugha nyingine inayoweza kuongezwa sasa.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'Imeshindwa kuhamisha %s mahali pake.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until