main supplement.'=>'Mchango wa kila kijenzi kwenye nyongeza ya default domain inayoshirikiwa ya kila lugha.','Enable Babilim'=>'Washa Babilim','Enabling…'=>'Inawezesha…','English (United States)'=>'Kiingereza (Marekani)','Entries'=>'Ingizo','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Idadi ya maingizo hailingani kwa %s','Error reports'=>'Ripoti za hitilafu','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'Kila locale inayotumika kwenye tovuti hii (locale ya tovuti, vifurushi vya lugha vilivyosakinishwa, locale za watumiaji, na zozote unazoongeza mwenyewe). Hakuna locale inayotendewa tofauti na nyingine.','Excluded'=>'Imeondolewa','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'Faili zenye majina au viendelezi vingine hazijajumuishwa, wala folda za uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules na languages, faili zilizofichwa, au faili ambazo majina yake yanalingana na siri za kawaida (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Faili za msimbo bado zinaweza kuwa na maandishi au data ambazo hungependa kushiriki; zikague ikiwa huna uhakika. Huduma huondoa aina hizo hizo za faili tena inapozipokea.','Free'=>'Bila malipo','Free-plan slots'=>'Nafasi za mpango wa bure','General'=>'Jumla','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Ikiwa hii imewashwa, kusanidua pia kunafuta utambulisho wa tovuti hii. Leseni ya kulipia iliyounganishwa na tovuti hii haiwezi kurejeshwa kiotomatiki baadaye; utalazimika kuwasiliana na Usaidizi wa Babilim kupitia %s ili kuipata tena.','Included'=>'Imejumuishwa','Included in index'=>'Imejumuishwa kwenye faharasa','Install available translations automatically'=>'Sakinisha tafsiri zilizopo kiotomatiki','Installed'=>'Zilizosakinishwa','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Tafsiri zilizosakinishwa huhifadhiwa, lakini hakutakuwa na ukaguzi wala upakuaji zaidi.','Installed · %s'=>'Imesakinishwa · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa %1$s, tovuti hii ina %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa %s','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa %s, toleo jipya limeshindwa','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa %s, toleo jipya limepangwa','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa %s, inatafsiri toleo jipya…','Installed · built for %s; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Imesakinishwa · imeundwa kwa %s; programu-jalizi au mandhari hii haijumuishwi tena katika mpango wa huduma wa tovuti','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa toleo tofauti','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa toleo tofauti, toleo jipya limeshindwa','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa toleo tofauti, toleo jipya limepangwa','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Imesakinishwa · imejengwa kwa toleo tofauti, inatafsiri toleo jipya…','Installed · built for a different version; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Imesakinishwa · imeundwa kwa toleo tofauti; programu-jalizi au mandhari hii haijumuishwi tena katika mpango wa huduma wa tovuti','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Huhifadhiwa na mtoa huduma wa upangishaji wa huduma hiyo na kuchakatwa na miundo ya AI ili kutoa tafsiri.','Language'=>'Lugha','Language:'=>'Lugha:','Languages'=>'Lugha','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Lugha zilizopatikana kwenye tovuti hii: %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Usafishaji wa mwisho tarehe %1$s: %2$d zimewekwa alama mpya, faili %3$d zimefutwa, rekodi %4$d zimeondolewa.','Maintenance'=>'Matengenezo','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'Hali ya matengenezo haipatikani kwa sasa.','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest haipatikani: %s','Negation reversed'=>'Ukanushi umegeuzwa','No'=>'Hapana','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Hakuna toleo linalopatikana la kupakua kwa lugha hii.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Hakuna usafishaji uliofanyika bado.','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Hakuna vijenzi vinavyolingana na vichujio hivi. %s','No components synced yet.'=>'Hakuna vijenzi vilivyosawazishwa bado.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Hakuna tafsiri iliyosakinishwa inayolingana.','No language is managed yet.'=>'Hakuna lugha inayosimamiwa bado.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Hakuna changamoto inayosubiri kwa nonce hii.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Hakuna changamoto inayosubiri kuthibitishwa.','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Hakuna programu-jalizi au mandhari zilizopatikana.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Hakuna toleo la awali la kurudishia.','No record for %s'=>'Hakuna rekodi ya %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Hakuna kitambulisho cha tovuti kwenye faili cha kubadilishia tokeni.','No — component inactive'=>'Hapana — kijenzi hakitumiki','No — component removed'=>'Hapana — kijenzi kimeondolewa','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Hapana — toleo lililosakinishwa ni tofauti na lile linalotumika','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Si server_build_id halali: %s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'Haijajumuishwa katika mpango wa huduma wa bure','Not installed'=>'Haijasakinishwa','Not registered yet'=>'Bado haijasajiliwa','Not supported'=>'Haitumiki','Not verified'=>'Haijathibitishwa','Note (optional)'=>'Maelezo (si lazima)','Nothing to choose.'=>'Hakuna cha kuchagua.','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Hakuna cha kuthibitisha.','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: kufuta programu-jalizi huhifadhi utambulisho wa tovuti hii, ili usakinishaji upya uutumie tena.','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Faili moja au zaidi zinazotolewa hazilingani tena na manifest.','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ununuzi wa mara moja kwa tovuti hii: %1$s %2$s. Unajumuisha masasisho yote ya tafsiri yajayo. Malipo yanashughulikiwa na Paddle kwenye kichupo kipya.','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Ni msimamizi wa mtandao pekee anayeweza kufanya hivi, kwa sababu hubadilisha faili za tafsiri zinazoshirikiwa na kila tovuti kwenye mtandao huu.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Programu-jalizi na mandhari pekee ndizo zinazoweza kufungashwa.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Ni pale tu unapothibitisha upakiaji wa programu jalizi au mandhari ambayo haipo kwenye WordPress.org: kila faili ya .php na .js, kila faili ya block.json, na readme.txt, readme.md, style.css na theme.json katika folda kuu ya kijenzi hicho, kama zip, baada ya faili zinazolingana na siri za kawaida kuachwa.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya Babilim','Original language'=>'Lugha asili','Original string'=>'Maandishi asili','Paid'=>'Ya kulipia','Partner'=>'Mshirika','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Tafadhali hakikisha tovuti yako inaweza kufikiwa kutoka mtandaoni, kisha ujaribu tena.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Tafadhali chagua kategoria ya ripoti hii.','Plugin'=>'Programu-jalizi','Plugin · %s'=>'Programu-jalizi · %s','Plugins'=>'Programu-jalizi','Preview'=>'Hakiki','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Ununuzi umerejeshwa. Tovuti hii sasa ina leseni.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Idadi ya maingizo yaliyochanganuliwa upya haikulingana na faharasa iliyojengwa.','Re-verify'=>'Thibitisha upya','Rebuild index now'=>'Jenga upya faharasa sasa','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Inakataa kuandika nje ya saraka ya faili za lugha za Babilim.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Jibu la usajili halikuwa na sehemu zinazohitajika.','Registration restarted.'=>'Usajili umeanzishwa upya.','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Ondoa kila kitu ambacho Babilim ilisakinisha','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Ungependa kuondoa kila kitu ambacho Babilim ilisakinisha? Hii inafuta kila faili la lugha lililosakinishwa na Babilim kwa kila programu-jalizi na mandhari kwenye tovuti hii.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Ondoa tafsiri ya %2$s ya %1$s kwenye tovuti hii?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'Kijenzi %d kilichosakinishwa kimeondolewa.' . "\0" . 'Vijenzi %d vilivyosakinishwa vimeondolewa.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Imeondolewa baada ya ukaguzi wa uadilifu kushindwa','Removed.'=>'Imeondolewa.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Huondoa kila faili la lugha ambalo Babilim limesakinisha kwa kila programu-jalizi na mandhari kwenye tovuti hii.','Report a problem'=>'Ripoti tatizo','Report translation'=>'Ripoti tafsiri','Request newer translation'=>'Omba tafsiri mpya zaidi','Request translation'=>'Omba tafsiri','Requestable'=>'Inaweza kuombwa','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Kuomba tafsiri huweka programu-jalizi au mandhari hii kwenye mojawapo ya nafasi za mpango wa huduma wa bure kwa tovuti hii (kikomo ni %1$d kwa mandhari na %2$d kwa programu-jalizi), isipokuwa tayari ina nafasi. Nafasi hubaki ikitumika, na tafsiri iliyoshindwa haiiachilii.','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Kuomba tafsiri huweka programu-jalizi au mandhari hii kwenye mojawapo ya nafasi za mpango wa huduma wa bure kwa tovuti hii, isipokuwa tayari ina nafasi. Nafasi hubaki ikitumika, na tafsiri iliyoshindwa haiiachilii.','Requesting…'=>'Inaomba…','Restart registration'=>'Anzisha upya usajili','Restore code'=>'Msimbo wa kurejesha','Restore purchase'=>'Rejesha ununuzi','Retry request'=>'Jaribu tena ombi','Roll back'=>'Rudisha nyuma','Roll back and report'=>'Rudisha nyuma na uripoti','Roll back and send report'=>'Rudisha nyuma na utume ripoti','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'Rudisha tafsiri ya %2$s ya %1$s kwenye muundo uliotangulia?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Imerudishwa nyuma na kuripotiwa.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Imerudishwa kwenye toleo la awali.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Imerudishwa nyuma, lakini ripoti haikuweza kutumwa: %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Kurudisha toleo la awali kungeandika juu ya \'%1$s\' (%2$s), ambayo sasa inatolewa kwa kijenzi kingine kilichosakinishwa (%3$s); hakuna kilichobadilishwa.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'Jibu la kubadilisha tokeni halikuwa na site_token.','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Imepangwa, inasubiri kushughulikiwa','Search'=>'Tafuta','Search components'=>'Tafuta vijenzi','Search the installed translations'=>'Tafuta katika tafsiri zilizosakinishwa','Select all'=>'Chagua vyote','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Chagua vijenzi vichache zaidi: upeo wa shughuli %1$d kwa kila uendeshaji (umechagua %2$d).','Send report'=>'Tuma ripoti','Service plan'=>'Mpango wa huduma','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Share error reports'=>'Shiriki ripoti za hitilafu','Share this report'=>'Shiriki ripoti hii','Show a new restore code'=>'Onyesha msimbo mpya wa kurejesha','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Onyesha kipengee cha "Ripoti tafsiri" kwenye upau wa zana wa msimamizi','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Baadhi ya maandishi ya kijenzi hiki yameandikwa moja kwa moja na mwandishi wake na hayawezi kutafsiriwa na kifurushi cha lugha.','Status'=>'Hali','Status unknown'=>'Hali haijulikani','String context'=>'Muktadha wa mfuatano wa maneno','Suggested translation'=>'Tafsiri inayopendekezwa','Supplementary translation index'=>'Faharasa ya tafsiri za ziada','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Faharasa ya tafsiri ya ziada imejengwa upya.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Matengenezo ya tafsiri za ziada','Supplementary translations'=>'Tafsiri za ziada','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Usafishaji umesitishwa bila kufanya chochote kuwa yatima: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Usafishaji umekamilika: faili %d imefutwa.' . "\0" . 'Usafishaji umekamilika: faili %d zimefutwa.','Sweep now'=>'Safisha sasa','Sync complete.'=>'Usawazishaji umekamilika.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Asante. Ripoti yako imetumwa.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Kijenzi hicho hakijasakinishwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo tafsiri haiwezi kuombwa kwa ajili yake.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Hii haionekani kuwa msimbo wa kurejesha.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Hiyo si msimbo halali wa lugha wa WordPress. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Hicho si kitambulisho cha muundo halali.','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'Skrini hiyo ya kupakia ilikuwa imepitwa na wakati: upakiaji mwingine umeandaliwa tangu hapo. Hakuna kilichotumwa. Kagua ule wa sasa kutoka Orodha ya tafsiri.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Mabadiliko hayakuweza kurekodiwa kwenye faharasa ya tafsiri; tafadhali jaribu tena.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Usafishaji ulifanyika, lakini baadhi ya mabadiliko yake hayakuweza kurekodiwa kwenye faharasa ya tafsiri; usafishaji ujao utayajaribu tena.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Kijenzi hakina faili zinazoweza kupakiwa.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Kijenzi hakipo ndani ya saraka ya programu-jalizi au mandhari.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Faili kuu ya kijenzi haikupatikana.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Jibu la upakuaji halikuwa na eneo linaloweza kutumika.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'Kipengee hiki hufungua paneli ya kutafuta tafsiri ambazo Babilim ilisakinisha kwenye tovuti hii na kuripoti mojawapo.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Sehemu "%1$s" ni ndefu mno: ina herufi %2$d na kikomo ni %3$d. Hakuna kilichotumwa; tafadhali ifupishe na ujaribu tena.','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'Mpango wa huduma wa bure humpa kila tovuti idadi ndogo ya nafasi za programu-jalizi na mandhari; nafasi zinazotumika zinaonyeshwa katika Mipangilio baada ya kuwezesha Babilim.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Domain iliyotolewa \'%1$s\' hailingani na slug ya package manifest \'%2$s\' wala text_domain yake \'%3$s\'.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'Faharasa iliyounganishwa ya \'%s\' ilijengwa upya, lakini faharasa ya tafsiri haikuweza kuirekodi; ujenzi upya ujao utajaribu tena.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Maandishi asili na tafsiri zilizotengenezwa kutoka kwayo zitatolewa kwa tovuti nyingine zinazosakinisha toleo lilelile.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Kifurushi hakijatangaza faili kuu ya tafsiri.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Kifurushi hakina %s kwa ajili ya text domain yake yenyewe.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Aina \'%1$s\' ya package manifest hailingani na aina iliyoombwa \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Kifurushi hakikutoa faili kuu ya tafsiri inayoweza kutolewa.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Maandishi ya domain (text domain) ya kifurushi \'%1$s\' hayalingani na nakala ya kijenzi kwenye tovuti hii (\'%2$s\'), kwa hivyo hakikusakinishwa.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Kijenzi kilichofungashwa hakikuweza kusomwa.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Changamoto ya usajili haiko katika umbo linalotarajiwa.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Ripoti haikuweza kutumwa.','The search could not be completed.'=>'Utafutaji haukuweza kukamilika.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Huduma iliomba tovuti hii isubiri kabla ya kusawazisha tena.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Huduma haikuweza kufikia tovuti yako. Huenda ngome ya moto, programu-jalizi ya usalama au sheria ya mwenyeji inazuia ombi; tafadhali ruhusu maombi kwenda /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Ofa ya upakiaji ya huduma haikukamilika.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) tayari inatolewa kwa kijenzi kingine kilichosakinishwa (%3$s); hakuna kilichosakinishwa.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Upakiaji huhifadhiwa hadi utakapoomba Babilim iufute.','Theme'=>'Mandhari','Theme · %s'=>'Mandhari · %s','Themes'=>'Mandhari','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Hakuna upakiaji unaoendelea.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Hakuna upakiaji unaosubiri uthibitisho.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Hizi ndizo lugha zinazotumiwa na tovuti hii. Unaweza kuzibadilisha katika %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'Sehemu hizi zitatumwa:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Toleo hili si moja ambalo tovuti hii inalifahamu kwa sasa kwa kijenzi/lugha hii.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Kijenzi hiki hakitaji nambari ya toleo, kwa hivyo tafsiri haiwezi kuombwa kwa ajili yake.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Kijenzi hiki ni kikubwa kuliko huduma inavyokubali, kwa hivyo hakiwezi kupakiwa.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Kijenzi hiki kilishapakiwa. Babilim kinakikagua sasa.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Nambari ya toleo la kijenzi hiki ni ndefu kuliko herufi %d, jambo ambalo Babilim haiwezi kulishughulikia, kwa hivyo tafsiri haiwezi kuombwa kwa ajili yake.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Hii inatoa msimbo mpya wa kurejesha na ule wa awali utaacha kufanya kazi. Endelea?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Mtandao huu una tovuti nyingi mno kuzikagua moja baada ya nyingine, na baadhi yake huenda zimewekwa kufuta utambulisho wa Babilim programu-jalizi itakapofutwa. Leseni ya kulipia iliyounganishwa na tovuti kama hiyo haingeweza kurejeshwa kiotomatiki; ungelazimika kuwasiliana na Usaidizi wa Babilim kupitia %s. Ili kuhifadhi utambulisho, bofya Ghairi, ondoa tiki kwenye "Futa data yote ya Babilim wakati wa kusanidua" katika Mipangilio ya Babilim ya kila tovuti, kisha uzime tena. Zima hata hivyo?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Toleo la programu-jalizi hii yenyewe, ili huduma iweze kukuambia uisasishe ikiwa ni ya zamani mno kuweza kuwasiliana nayo.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Ripoti hii haitaji programu-jalizi au mandhari halali na lugha.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Ripoti hii haitaji mfuatano wa maandishi uliosakinishwa.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Ripoti hii haina toleo halali la kuripotia.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Ripoti hii itachapishwa hadharani kwenye GitHub na inaweza kuhifadhiwa na wahusika wengine.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Msimbo huu wa kurejesha haukutambuliwa kwa tovuti hii.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Tovuti hii tayari ina usajili unaotumika ambao hauwezi tena kurejeshwa kiotomatiki.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Tovuti hii ina vijenzi %1$d katika lugha %2$d, ambavyo vinahitaji makundi %3$d ya ukaguzi; Babilim inaweza kushughulikia upeo wa %4$d kwa kila uendeshaji. Punguza lugha zinazosimamiwa katika Mipangilio au zima programu-jalizi na mandhari zisizotumika, kisha bonyeza Angalia tena sasa.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Tovuti hii haina ununuzi wa kuonyeshwa msimbo.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Tovuti hii tayari ina leseni. Pakia upya ukurasa.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Tovuti hii bado haijasajiliwa na Babilim.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Tovuti hii ni kubwa kuliko ukubwa unaokubaliwa na huduma katika usawazishaji mmoja, kwa hivyo baadhi ya vipengee viliachwa: vijenzi %1$d na lugha %2$d.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Tovuti hii ni sehemu ya mtandao wa tovuti nyingi, ambao hausakinishi tafsiri mpya kiotomatiki. Tafsiri zilizosakinishwa tayari bado husasishwa.','This site is verified.'=>'Tovuti hii imethibitishwa.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Tovuti hii lazima ithibitishwe kwanza.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'URL ya tovuti hii, ili huduma iweze kuthibitisha kuwa wewe ndiye mmiliki.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Anwani ya tovuti hii ni ndefu mno kwa Babilim kuisajili.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Locale iliyosanidiwa ya tovuti hii.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Msimbo wa lugha wa tovuti hii si ule ambao Babilim inaweza kusajili.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Mfuatano huu hauwezi kuripotiwa kutoka tovuti hii.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Mfuatano huu wa maandishi haumo miongoni mwa tafsiri zilizosakinishwa kwenye tovuti hii. Tafuta tena na uuchague kutoka kwenye orodha.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Tafsiri hii ilisasishwa tangu ulipotafuta. Tafuta tena na uchague mfuatano wa maandishi kutoka kwenye orodha mpya.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Ili kutafsiri kijenzi hiki, Babilim inahitaji chanzo chake.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Majaribio mengi mno. Jaribu tena kesho.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Ripoti nyingi mno leo. Jaribu tena kesho.','Too many requests.'=>'Maombi mengi mno.','Toolbar'=>'Upau wa zana','Translating…'=>'Inatafsiri…','Translation does not load'=>'Tafsiri haipakiwi','Translation failed'=>'Tafsiri imeshindwa','Translation requested.'=>'Tafsiri imeombwa.','Translations'=>'Tafsiri','Type'=>'Aina','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Andika angalau herufi 2 ili kutafuta.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Jibu lisilotarajiwa la HTTP %d.','Uninstall'=>'Sanidua','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Aina isiyojulikana: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Kikoa si salama: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Locale isiyo salama: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug isiyo salama: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain isiyo salama: %s','Update'=>'Sasisha','Update available'=>'Sasisho linapatikana','Updates'=>'Masasisho','Updating…'=>'Inasasisha…','Upgrade this site'=>'Boresha tovuti hii','Upload and request'=>'Pakia na uombe','Upload cancelled.'=>'Upakiaji umeghairiwa.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Upakiaji umekamilika — tafsiri imeombwa.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Upakiaji ulikwisha muda kabla haujakamilika','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Upakiaji unaendelea — endelea au ghairi','Upload this component?'=>'Pakia kijenzi hiki?','Upload was not accepted'=>'Upakiaji haukukubaliwa','Uploading'=>'Inapakia','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Inapakia sehemu ya %1$d kati ya %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Inapakia…','Verified'=>'Imethibitishwa','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Jibu la uthibitishaji halikuwa na site_token.','Version %s'=>'Toleo %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Kinachotumwa unapowasha Babilim','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Ulipoona hili (si lazima)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Hii ikiwa imewashwa, tafsiri ambazo huduma inaorodhesha kuwa zinapatikana kwa lugha unazozisimamia husakinishwa wakati wa usawazishaji mara mbili kwa siku.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Si sahihi kwa muktadha huu','Wrong meaning'=>'Maana si sahihi','Wrong plural form'=>'Umbo la wingi si sahihi','Wrong term'=>'Neno la istilahi si sahihi','Yes'=>'Ndiyo','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Huruhusiwi kufanya hivi.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Toleo lako la PHP, kwa ajili ya uoanifu.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Toleo lako la WordPress, ili kutoa faili za tafsiri zinazooana.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Msimbo wako mpya wa kurejesha: %s. Uhifadhi mahali salama — msimbo wa awali haufanyi kazi tena.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Ripoti yako huchakatwa kiotomatiki na mifumo ya AI na inaweza kuboresha tafsiri hii kwa tovuti nyingine.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Tovuti yako ilijibu, lakini si kwa kilichotarajiwa. REST API huenda imebadilishwa na programu-jalizi nyingine, au sehemu hiyo ya mwisho huenda imehifadhiwa kwenye akiba; tafadhali ondoa /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge kwenye uhifadhi wa akiba na ubadilishaji.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Tovuti yako ilichukua muda mrefu mno kujibu. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye, na uhakikishe mwenyeji wako si polepole sana au amelemewa.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip haina manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip haina faili chaguomsingi inayotarajiwa: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip haina faili inayotarajiwa: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json ina muundo usiotarajiwa','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'imeshindwa kusoma _manifest.json: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'%s\' haipo katika expected_manifest au ina thamani isiyo halali.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' ya expected_manifest si kitambulisho halali cha toleo (build id).','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'imeshindwa kuchanganua _manifest.json: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'ingefanya %1$d kati ya vijenzi %2$d vinavyosimamiwa kuwa yatima (zaidi ya nusu)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'ingefanya kila kijenzi cha %1$s kinachosimamiwa kuwa yatima (%2$d kati ya %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Idadi ya maingizo ya l10n.php hailingani kwa %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json ina default_domain_entries isiyo halali.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json ina \'default_domain_files\' isiyo halali.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json iliyo ndani ya zip si JSON halali.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'%s\' haipo katika manifest.json au ina thamani isiyo halali.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'build_no\' haipo katika manifest.json au ina thamani isiyo halali.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'entries\' haipo katika manifest.json au ina thamani isiyo halali.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'extra_domains\' haipo katika manifest.json au ina thamani isiyo halali.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'Sehemu ya \'files\' haipo katika manifest.json au ina thamani isiyo halali.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'\'%s\' ya manifest.json hailingani na thamani inayotarajiwa.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'\'contract\' ya manifest.json si mfuatano halali wa toleo.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'\'kind\' ya manifest.json lazima iwe \'plugin\' au \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' ya manifest.json si kitambulisho cha muundo halali.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'\'status\' ya manifest.json lazima iwe \'published\'.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce lazima iwe mfuatano wa heksadesimali.','per day'=>'kwa siku','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'kutolingana kwa sha256 kwa %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'kutolingana kwa sha256 kwa default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'programu-jalizi','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'mandhari','problem report categoryOther'=>'Nyingine','translation statusAvailable'=>'Inapatikana','translation statusInstalled'=>'Imesakinishwa','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Tafsiri ya Babilim imezimwa.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Acha kutumia tafsiri ya Babilim','Use Babilim translation'=>'Tumia tafsiri ya Babilim','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Acha kutumia tafsiri ya Babilim ya %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress itatumia tafsiri ya mandhari yenyewe au ya WordPress.org badala yake. Unaweza kurudi wakati wowote.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Acha kutumia tafsiri ya Babilim ya %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress itatumia tafsiri ya programu-jalizi yenyewe au ya WordPress.org badala yake. Unaweza kurudi wakati wowote.','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'Unafurahia Babilim? Tafadhali acha ukadiriaji kwenye WordPress.org.','Rate Babilim'=>'Kadiria Babilim','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'tafsiri ya Babilim iliyojumuishwa na mandhari','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'tafsiri ya Babilim iliyojumuishwa na programu jalizi','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Kwa kila programu jalizi na mandhari iliyosakinishwa: jina lake (slagi), toleo, text domain, ikiwa imeorodheshwa kwenye WordPress.org, lugha ambazo tayari inajumuisha, na ni zipi kati ya tafsiri hizo zilizojumuishwa ambazo Babilim ilizalisha (misimbo ya lugha pekee). Kwa kila tafsiri ya Babilim uliyosakinisha: ni toleo gani, lini ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho, na ikiwa ilipita ukaguzi wa faili.','Working…'=>'Inafanya kazi…','Babilim could not finish this. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Babilim haikuweza kukamilisha hili. Pakia upya ukurasa kisha ujaribu tena.','This translation does not have the number of forms the language needs.'=>'Tafsiri hii haina idadi ya maumbo ambayo lugha inahitaji.','This translation is empty.'=>'Tafsiri hii ni tupu.','The text has invalid characters or control characters.'=>'Maandishi yana herufi zisizo halali au herufi za udhibiti.','The HTML tags must match the original: same tags, each opened and closed as in the original.'=>'Lebo za HTML lazima zilingane na Asili: lebo zilezile, kila moja ikifunguliwa na kufungwa kama ilivyo katika Asili.','The translation has %s, which the original does not. Keep the placeholders of the original; to write a plain percent sign next to a letter, add a space or write %%%%.'=>'Tafsiri ina %s, ambayo Asili haina. Weka vishikilia nafasi vya Asili; ili kuandika alama ya asilimia ya kawaida karibu na herufi, ongeza nafasi au andika %%%%.','The translation has a lone percent sign that would break the text. Write 100%% for a literal percent sign.'=>'Tafsiri ina alama ya asilimia pekee ambayo ingevunja maandishi. Andika 100%% kwa alama halisi ya asilimia.','Unsafe override scope.'=>'Wigo wa kubatilisha si salama.','The override files could not be written.'=>'Faili za kubatilisha hazikuweza kuandikwa.','That plugin, theme, text domain or language is not available here.'=>'Programu-jalizi, mandhari, kikoa cha maandishi au lugha hiyo haipatikani hapa.','The editor could not complete that request.'=>'Kihariri hakikuweza kukamilisha ombi hilo.','The translation did not pass the checks, so it was not saved. Your text is kept as a draft.'=>'Tafsiri haikupita ukaguzi, kwa hivyo haikuhifadhiwa. Maandishi yako yamehifadhiwa kama rasimu.','The table that stores edited translations does not exist yet.'=>'Jedwali linalohifadhi tafsiri zilizohaririwa bado halipo.','That plugin or theme is not installed.'=>'Programu-jalizi au mandhari hiyo haijasakinishwa.','That string is not in this translation.'=>'Maandishi hayo hayamo katika tafsiri hii.','The translation could not be saved.'=>'Tafsiri haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Edit translations'=>'Hariri tafsiri','Edit translations: %1$s, %2$s'=>'Hariri tafsiri: %1$s, %2$s','There is nothing to edit yet. Install a plugin or theme, or add a language, and it shows up here.'=>'Hakuna cha kuhariri bado. Sakinisha programu-jalizi au mandhari, au ongeza lugha, nacho kitaonekana hapa.','Choose a plugin or theme and a language to edit its translation.'=>'Chagua programu-jalizi au mandhari na lugha ili kuhariri tafsiri yake.','Name'=>'Jina','Edit'=>'Hariri','Back to all plugins and themes'=>'Rudi kwenye programu-jalizi na mandhari zote','Text domain'=>'Kikoa cha maandishi','Show'=>'Onyesha','The editor needs JavaScript. Everything else in Babilim works without it.'=>'Kihariri kinahitaji JavaScript. Kila kitu kingine katika Babilim hufanya kazi bila hiyo.','Untranslated'=>'Haijatafsiriwa','Needs review'=>'Inahitaji ukaguzi','No longer used'=>'Haitumiki tena','From Babilim'=>'Kutoka Babilim','From WordPress.org'=>'Kutoka WordPress.org','From the plugin or theme'=>'Kutoka kwenye programu-jalizi au mandhari','Save'=>'Hifadhi','You are logged out. Log in again in another tab, then press Save.'=>'Umetoka kwenye akaunti. Ingia tena katika kichupo kingine, kisha bonyeza Hifadhi.','This text is not saved yet. It stays in the field.'=>'Maandishi haya bado hayajahifadhiwa. Yanabaki kwenye sehemu ya kuandika.','Form %d'=>'Fomu %d','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Original text'=>'Maandishi asili','Context'=>'Muktadha','Note for translators'=>'Maelezo kwa watafsiri','Previous page'=>'Ukurasa uliotangulia','Next page'=>'Ukurasa unaofuata','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ukurasa %1$d kati ya %2$d','No more untranslated strings on this page.'=>'Hakuna tena maandishi ambayo hayajatafsiriwa kwenye ukurasa huu.','No strings match.'=>'Hakuna maandishi yanayolingana.','No strings found. This plugin or theme does not ship a translation template.'=>'Hakuna maandishi yaliyopatikana. Programu-jalizi au mandhari hii haina kiolezo cha tafsiri.','The translation file could not be written yet. It is tried again automatically every day.'=>'Faili la tafsiri halikuweza kuandikwa bado. Hujaribiwa tena kiotomatiki kila siku.','Edit this text'=>'Hariri maandishi haya','Has problems'=>'Ina matatizo','%d string'=>'Mfuatano %d' . "\0" . 'Mifuatano %d','%d untranslated'=>'%d haijatafsiriwa' . "\0" . '%d hazijatafsiriwa','%d edited by you'=>'%d imehaririwa na wewe' . "\0" . '%d zimehaririwa na wewe','%d change is live.'=>'Badiliko %d liko hai.' . "\0" . 'Mabadiliko %d yako hai.','%d change is saved.'=>'Badiliko %d limehifadhiwa.' . "\0" . 'Mabadiliko %d yamehifadhiwa.','%d draft needs fixing and was not saved.'=>'Rasimu %d inahitaji kurekebishwa na haikuhifadhiwa.' . "\0" . 'Rasimu %d zinahitaji kurekebishwa na hazikuhifadhiwa.','%d change could not be saved.'=>'Badiliko %d halikuweza kuhifadhiwa.' . "\0" . 'Mabadiliko %d hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Nothing to save.'=>'Hakuna cha kuhifadhi.','Save %d change'=>'Hifadhi badiliko %d' . "\0" . 'Hifadhi mabadiliko %d','%d draft saved, not live yet'=>'Rasimu %d imehifadhiwa, bado haijawa hai' . "\0" . 'Rasimu %d zimehifadhiwa, bado hazijawa hai','%d needs fixing and stays a draft'=>'%d inahitaji kurekebishwa na inabaki rasimu' . "\0" . '%d zinahitaji kurekebishwa na zinabaki rasimu','Discard %d draft? Your live translations stay as they are.'=>'Je, utatupa rasimu %d? Tafsiri zako zilizo hai zitabaki kama zilivyo.' . "\0" . 'Je, utatupa rasimu %d? Tafsiri zako zilizo hai zitabaki kama zilivyo.','%s (theme)'=>'%s (mandhari)','Plugin or theme'=>'Programu jalizi au mandhari','Discard drafts…'=>'Tupa rasimu…','Show strings'=>'Onyesha mfuatano wa maandishi','Text, context, notes or file name'=>'Maandishi, muktadha, maelezo au jina la faili','Searches the original text, the translation, the context, notes for translators and the file the string comes from.'=>'Hutafuta maandishi asili, tafsiri, muktadha, maelezo kwa watafsiri na faili ambako mfuatano wa maandishi unatoka.','Sort'=>'Panga','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Untranslated first'=>'Zisizotafsiriwa kwanza','Recently edited'=>'Zilizohaririwa hivi karibuni','A–Z'=>'A–Z','Source'=>'Chanzo','All sources'=>'Vyanzo vyote','Original'=>'Asili','Edit the selected string'=>'Hariri mfuatano wa maandishi uliochaguliwa','Details and history'=>'Maelezo na historia','Edited by you'=>'Zilizohaririwa na wewe','Form %1$d: %2$s'=>'Umbo %1$d: %2$s','Translation (%s)'=>'Tafsiri (%s)','This language uses one form for every number.'=>'Lugha hii hutumia umbo moja kwa kila nambari.','Plural forms'=>'Maumbo ya wingi','empty'=>'tupu','problem'=>'tatizo','Original (singular)'=>'Asili (umoja)','Original (plural)'=>'Asili (wingi)','Copy original'=>'Nakili asili','Details'=>'Maelezo','History'=>'Historia','WordPress.org language pack'=>'Kifurushi cha lugha cha WordPress.org','Bundled with the plugin or theme'=>'Iliyojumuishwa na programu jalizi au mandhari','Yours (edited by you)'=>'Yako (zilizohaririwa na wewe)','Found in'=>'Imepatikana katika','Restore'=>'Rejesha','Live'=>'Hai','Draft'=>'Rasimu','Draft · Problem'=>'Rasimu · Tatizo','Bundled'=>'Iliyojumuishwa','Yours'=>'Yako','(plural)'=>'(wingi)','Discard this draft'=>'Tupa rasimu hii','Drafts discarded.'=>'Rasimu zimetupwa.','Draft discarded.'=>'Rasimu imetupwa.','This draft is kept, but it does not go live with Save until it is fixed. Your other changes still go live.'=>'Rasimu hii imehifadhiwa, lakini haitaanza kutumika hai kwa Hifadhi hadi irekebishwe. Mabadiliko yako mengine bado yataanza kutumika.','Draft saved at %s. Not live yet.'=>'Rasimu imehifadhiwa saa %s. Bado haijaanza kutumika.','Visitors still see the live text until you press Save.'=>'Wageni bado wanaona maandishi yaliyo hai hadi utakapobonyeza Hifadhi.','Live now: %1$s (%2$s)'=>'Hai sasa: %1$s (%2$s)','Ctrl'=>'Ctrl','Enter'=>'Enter','next string'=>'mfuatano unaofuata','previous / next'=>'iliyotangulia / inayofuata','copy original'=>'nakili asili','clear'=>'futa','Open'=>'Fungua','Babilim – Auto Translation & Language Packs'=>'Babilim – Tafsiri Kiotomatiki na Vifurushi vya Lugha','Auto-translate every plugin and theme on your site, then fine-tune any line in a fast built-in editor. Your edits survive updates.'=>'Tafsiri kiotomatiki kila programu jalizi na mandhari kwenye tovuti yako, kisha boresha mstari wowote katika kihariri cha haraka kilichojengewa ndani. Marekebisho yako hudumu baada ya masasisho.','%d change to review'=>'Badiliko %d la kukagua' . "\0" . 'Mabadiliko %d ya kukagua','No translation yet'=>'Bado hakuna tafsiri','The original text changed in %1$s %2$s.'=>'Maandishi asili yalibadilika katika %1$s %2$s.','Your translation was written for the old text, so the site no longer shows it. Choose what to use for the new text.'=>'Tafsiri yako iliandikwa kwa maandishi ya zamani, kwa hivyo tovuti haiioneshi tena. Chagua cha kutumia kwa maandishi mapya.','Old original'=>'Asili ya zamani','New original'=>'Asili mpya','Your translation (for the old text)'=>'Tafsiri yako (ya maandishi ya zamani)','Your current translation'=>'Tafsiri yako ya sasa','Use my text'=>'Tumia maandishi yangu','New translation from %s'=>'Tafsiri mpya kutoka %s','Use the new translation'=>'Tumia tafsiri mpya','Keep my current translation'=>'Weka tafsiri yangu ya sasa','Discard my text'=>'Tupa maandishi yangu','Whichever you choose becomes a draft and goes live with Save, like any other change.'=>'Utakachochagua kitakuwa rasimu na kuanza kutumika kwa Hifadhi, kama mabadiliko mengine yoyote.','Or edit it yourself'=>'Au ihariri mwenyewe','This text is no longer used: %1$s %2$s does not have this string any more.'=>'Maandishi haya hayatumiki tena: %1$s %2$s haina mfuatano huu tena.','Delete…'=>'Futa…','Delete your translation of this text? It is not shown anywhere on the site.'=>'Ungependa kufuta tafsiri yako ya maandishi haya? Haionyeshwi popote kwenye tovuti.','Translation deleted.'=>'Tafsiri imefutwa.','That text is still in use, so it cannot be removed here.'=>'Maandishi hayo bado yanatumika, kwa hivyo hayawezi kuondolewa hapa.','%1$s – %2$s'=>'%1$s – %2$s','Removed text:'=>'Maandishi yaliyoondolewa:','Added text:'=>'Maandishi yaliyoongezwa:','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service: what failed, where and when, a random report ID, the versions and the site language. Only the error, where it happened and the versions are published as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Kitu kikishindwa ndani ya Babilim, tuma ripoti ya hitilafu kwa huduma ya Babilim: kilichoshindwa, mahali na wakati, kitambulisho cha ripoti cha nasibu, matoleo na lugha ya tovuti. Hitilafu tu, mahali ilipotokea na matoleo huchapishwa kama suala la umma kwenye GitHub; suala hilo la umma halina anwani ya tovuti, maudhui wala njia za faili. Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi.','Translation edits'=>'Marekebisho ya tafsiri','Share my edits with Babilim'=>'Shiriki marekebisho yangu na Babilim','When you change a translation that came from Babilim, your version is sent with the original text, Babilim\'s translation, the plugin or theme, the language and the build. Babilim processes it with AI models and may use it to improve that translation for every site. Off by default.'=>'Unapobadilisha tafsiri iliyotoka kwa Babilim, toleo lako hutumwa pamoja na maandishi asili, tafsiri ya Babilim, programu-jalizi au mandhari, lugha na toleo la ujenzi. Babilim huichakata kwa miundo ya AI na inaweza kuitumia kuboresha tafsiri hiyo kwa kila tovuti. Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi.','Your own translations'=>'Tafsiri zako mwenyewe','Keep my translations when removing everything or uninstalling Babilim.'=>'Hifadhi tafsiri zangu ninapoondoa kila kitu au ninapoondoa Babilim.','Your edits and the files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. Unchecking this deletes them when you remove everything or uninstall.'=>'Marekebisho yako na faili unazoweka katika %s daima huchukua kipaumbele kuliko za Babilim. Ukiondoa alama hii, zitafutwa unapoondoa kila kitu au unapoondoa programu-jalizi.','Files: %s.'=>'Faili: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'Zilizoletwa: %s.','Already identical: %s.'=>'Tayari zinafanana: %s.','Kept your existing translation: %s.'=>'Tafsiri yako iliyopo ilihifadhiwa: %s.','Imported, but no longer used in this version: %s.'=>'Zilizoletwa, lakini hazitumiki tena katika toleo hili: %s.','Kept as drafts to fix: %s.'=>'Zimehifadhiwa kama rasimu za kurekebishwa: %s.','Skipped: %s.'=>'Zilizorukwa: %s.','Review the import'=>'Kagua uletaji','Loco Translate\'s files are not changed. Deactivate Loco Translate yourself when you are ready.'=>'Faili za Loco Translate hazibadilishwi. Zima Loco Translate mwenyewe ukiwa tayari.','Import from Loco Translate'=>'Leta kutoka Loco Translate','Found %s Loco Translate file you can import.'=>'Imepatikana faili %s ya Loco Translate unayoweza kuleta.' . "\0" . 'Zimepatikana faili %s za Loco Translate unazoweza kuleta.','Get the text list from Babilim'=>'Pata orodha ya maandishi kutoka Babilim','Sends the plugin\'s or theme\'s name and version to Babilim.'=>'Hutuma jina na toleo la programu-jalizi au mandhari kwa Babilim.','Babilim is preparing the list. This takes a few minutes.'=>'Babilim inaandaa orodha. Hii huchukua dakika chache.','Enable Babilim to get the text list for this plugin or theme.'=>'Washa Babilim ili kupata orodha ya maandishi ya programu-jalizi au mandhari hii.','Babilim cannot list the text of this plugin or theme: it is not on WordPress.org and it ships no translation template.'=>'Babilim haiwezi kuorodhesha maandishi ya programu-jalizi au mandhari hii: haipo kwenye WordPress.org na haina kiolezo cha tafsiri.','Babilim found no translatable text in this version.'=>'Babilim haikupata maandishi yanayoweza kutafsiriwa katika toleo hili.','The editor session has expired.'=>'Kipindi cha mhariri kimeisha muda.','That plugin or theme is not available here.'=>'Programu-jalizi au mandhari hiyo haipatikani hapa.','Some Loco Translate files could not be read.'=>'Baadhi ya faili za Loco Translate hazikuweza kusomwa.','This plugin or theme is not on WordPress.org.'=>'Programu-jalizi au mandhari hii haipo kwenye WordPress.org.','Babilim returned an invalid text list.'=>'Babilim ilirudisha orodha ya maandishi isiyo halali.','The text list could not be saved.'=>'Orodha ya maandishi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.']];